{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52138","headline":"题尼莲河七言 · 玄奘","name":"题尼莲河七言","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"尼莲河水正东流，曾浴金人体得柔。\n自此更谁登彼岸，西看佛树几千秋。\n（按：《大唐西域记》卷八《伽耶城与伽耶山》云：「戒贤伽蓝西南行四五十里，渡尼连禅河。\n」）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"玄奘","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52138.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52138","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}